### Admin A — Get Payment
GET {{adminABaseUrl}}/admin/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Admin A — Claim Payment
POST {{adminABaseUrl}}/admin/payments/{{paymentId}}/claim

### Admin A — Repeat Claim
# Expected: 200
# The claim expiration should not be extended.
POST {{adminABaseUrl}}/admin/payments/{{paymentId}}/claim

### Admin B — Login
POST {{adminBBaseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "olivia.martin@snackdemo.com",
  "password": "1q2w3e4r!"
}

### Admin B — Get Payment
GET {{adminBBaseUrl}}/admin/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Admin B — Claim While Admin A Owns Active Claim
# Expected: 409 Conflict
POST {{adminBBaseUrl}}/admin/payments/{{paymentId}}/claim

### Missing Payment
# Expected: 404 Not Found
POST {{adminABaseUrl}}/admin/payments/999999/claim